      "content": "that makes sense. but looking at the actual data, does it feel like the 'critics' have a point? i mean, if you look at some of the recent pushback in big tech or even legal challenges, it seems like there's a real argument that these programs can actually be counterproductive or even discriminatory against certain groups. do you think the consensus is starting to shift toward seeing DEI as a net negative for meritocracy?",
